print_formats.html:
{#- A COPY owes a source: the VAT figure and the charge rows below are the seeded 'mPOS Receipt' (ivendnext/iVendNext_PWA ·
    apps/ivendnext_mpos/ivendnext_mpos/install.py · RECEIPT_FORMAT_HTML @ 05bb4dab9). A defect here is a defect there:
    report it with a Kit defect issue. -#}
{#- The totals (0.1.1): the Discount row prints AFTER the Total, as "Discount included in the total", outside the sum.
    net_total already has the discount inside it, so as a step in the sum the printed lines did not add up; and no field
    holds the discount's untaxed share, so it cannot go before the subtotal either. A Rounding row prints the sale's own
    rounding_adjustment when it rounds, so Subtotal + VAT + Charges + Rounding = Total. Bound: on a discount applied to
    the net total, discount_amount is the amount before VAT, so the included figure is smaller than the drop in the total. -#}
{#- S4 — UAE tax invoice on the till sale (a POS Invoice print format), English beside Arabic.
    It PRINTS money the shop has already worked out; it never computes any: every amount is a figure on the
    sale itself. The only sums it makes are of the sale's own net amounts, to show the taxable value at each rate.
    Rates come from the sale's own lines (the item_tax_rate each line was booked with), never from this file.
    Everything is read from the sale itself (0.1.2): the company is its own company, the address is the formatted company
    address the sale already holds (the shop puts it there when the sale is saved: the POS Profile's Company Address, or
    else the Company's own address; a sale with neither prints none), and the tax
    registration number is a field on the sale that copies the Company's tax ID when the sale is saved (company_trn where
    the shop's UAE setup has added it, else the pp_rcp_company_tax_id field this package adds). A sale saved before the
    install has no copy, so it reprints without the number. Nothing is read from any other record. -#}
{#- Money text for a figure this template works out itself (a taxable value, the VAT, a charge): a figure has no field, and
    get_formatted takes a field, so the figure is put on write_off_amount, a currency field this layout never prints,
    formatted with the shop's own currency and number format, and the field's own value put back. The print view loads
    the sale afresh for every print and never saves it. Do not print write_off_amount in this layout. -#}
{%- macro money(v) -%}
  {%- set keep = doc.write_off_amount -%}
  {%- set _ = doc.update({"write_off_amount": v}) -%}
  {{- doc.get_formatted("write_off_amount") -}}
  {%- set _ = doc.update({"write_off_amount": keep}) -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set tax_no = doc.get("company_trn") or doc.get("pp_rcp_company_tax_id") -%}
{%- set taxrows = [] -%}
{%- for t in doc.taxes or [] -%}{%- if not t.get("custom_surcharge") -%}{%- set _ = taxrows.append(t) -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- set default_rate = (taxrows | map(attribute="rate") | map("float") | sum) if taxrows else 0 -%}
{#- The VAT rate of one line, as BOOKED: for each tax row, the rate the line's own item_tax_rate (a stored text such as
    {"VAT - ICG": 15.0}) holds for that tax account, else the row's own rate. Read as text: a print template has no JSON reader. -#}
{%- macro rate_of(item) -%}
  {%- set r = namespace(v=0.0) -%}
  {%- for t in taxrows -%}
    {%- set k = '"' ~ t.account_head ~ '": ' -%}
    {%- set raw = item.item_tax_rate or "" -%}
    {%- set own = raw.split(k)[1].split(",")[0].split("}")[0] if k in raw else None -%}
    {%- set r.v = r.v + (own if own is not none else (t.rate or 0)) | float -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {{ r.v }}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set ns = namespace(taxable={}, order=[]) -%}
{%- for item in doc.items -%}
  {%- set rate = rate_of(item) | float -%}
  {%- set key = "%g" | format(rate) -%}
  {%- if key not in ns.taxable -%}{%- set _ = ns.order.append(key) -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- set _ = ns.taxable.update({key: (ns.taxable.get(key, 0) + (item.net_amount or 0))}) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{#- The VAT figure, as the seeded receipt and the till screen print it: item-charge money (Item Surcharge rows) and the delivery
    charge ride total_taxes_and_charges but are NOT tax, so they come off and print as their own "Charges" row. -#}
{%- set charge_rows = doc.get("custom_item_surcharges") or [] -%}
{%- set dlv = namespace(v=0.0) -%}
{%- for t in doc.taxes or [] -%}{%- if t.get("custom_surcharge") and t.description in ("Fulfillment Charges", "Fulfillment Tax") -%}{%- set dlv.v = dlv.v + (t.tax_amount or 0) -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- set tax_figure = ((doc.custom_tax_before_surcharge or 0) if charge_rows else (doc.total_taxes_and_charges or 0)) - dlv.v -%}
{%- set charges = (doc.total_taxes_and_charges or 0) - tax_figure -%}
{%- set tx = receipt_tax_detail(doc, tax_figure) if receipt_tax_detail is defined else {"lines": []} -%}
<div class="pp-rcp" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; width: 72mm; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="text-align:center;"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
  <div style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px;">{{ doc.company }}</div>
  {%- if doc.company_address_display %}
  <div style="text-align:center;">{{ doc.company_address_display }}</div>
  {%- endif %}
  <table style="width:100%;"><tr>
    <td>Tax Registration No.</td><td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">{{ tax_no or "—" }}</td>
    <td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">رقم التسجيل الضريبي</td>
  </tr></table>
  <table style="width:100%; margin:4px 0; font-weight:bold; font-size:12px;"><tr>
    {%- if doc.is_return %}
    <td>Tax Credit Note</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">إشعار دائن ضريبي</td>
    {%- else %}
    <td>Tax Invoice</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">فاتورة ضريبية</td>
    {%- endif %}
  </tr></table>
  {%- if doc.custom_printed %}
  <div style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px;">** DUPLICATE ** &nbsp; ** نسخة **</div>
  {%- endif %}
  <table style="width:100%;">
    <tr><td>Invoice No.</td><td style="text-align:center;">{{ doc.name }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">رقم الفاتورة</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Date</td><td style="text-align:center;">{{ doc.get_formatted("posting_date") }} {{ doc.get_formatted("posting_time") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">التاريخ</td></tr>
    {%- if doc.customer_name %}
    <tr><td>Customer</td><td style="text-align:center;">{{ doc.customer_name }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">العميل</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if doc.get("custom_buyer_tax_id") or doc.tax_id %}
    <tr><td>Customer TRN</td><td style="text-align:center;">{{ doc.get("custom_buyer_tax_id") or doc.tax_id }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">الرقم الضريبي للعميل</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
  </table>
  <hr>
  <table style="width:100%;">
    <tr style="font-weight:bold;">
      <td>Item / <span dir="rtl" lang="ar">الصنف</span></td>
      <td style="text-align:center;">VAT % / <span dir="rtl" lang="ar">الضريبة</span></td>
      <td style="text-align:right;">Amount / <span dir="rtl" lang="ar">المبلغ</span></td>
    </tr>
    {%- for item in doc.items %}
    {%- set rate = rate_of(item) | float %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ item.item_name or item.item_code }}{% if item.qty != 1 %}<br>{{ item.get_formatted("qty") }} × {{ item.get_formatted("rate") }}{% endif %}{% if item.serial_no %}<br>S/N {{ item.serial_no | e }}{% endif %}</td>
      <td style="text-align:center;">{{ "%g" | format(rate) }}%</td>
      <td style="text-align:right;">{{ item.get_formatted("amount") }}</td>
    </tr>
    {%- endfor %}
  </table>
  <hr>
  <table style="width:100%;">
    <tr><td>Subtotal (excl. VAT)</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ doc.get_formatted("net_total") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">المجموع قبل الضريبة</td></tr>
    {%- for key in ns.order | sort(reverse=True) %}
    <tr><td>Taxable value @ {{ key }}%</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ money(ns.taxable[key]) }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">القيمة الخاضعة {{ key }}%</td></tr>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- if tx.lines %}
    {%- for t in tx.lines %}
    <tr><td>{{ t.label | e }}</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ money(t.amount) }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">ضريبة القيمة المضافة</td></tr>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- else %}
    <tr><td>VAT</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ money(tax_figure) }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">ضريبة القيمة المضافة</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if charges | round(2) %}
    <tr><td>Charges</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ money(charges) }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">رسوم</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if doc.rounded_total and doc.rounding_adjustment %}
    <tr><td>Rounding</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ doc.get_formatted("rounding_adjustment") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">التقريب</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    <tr style="font-weight:bold; font-size:12px;"><td>Total</td><td style="text-align:right;">{% if doc.rounded_total %}{{ doc.get_formatted("rounded_total") }}{% else %}{{ doc.get_formatted("grand_total") }}{% endif %}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">الإجمالي</td></tr>
    {%- if doc.discount_amount %}
    <tr><td>Discount included in the total</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ doc.get_formatted("discount_amount") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">الخصم المشمول في الإجمالي</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- for p in doc.payments %}
    {%- if p.amount %}
    <tr><td>{{ p.mode_of_payment }}</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ p.get_formatted("amount") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">المدفوع</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- if doc.change_amount %}
    <tr><td>Change</td><td style="text-align:right;">{{ doc.get_formatted("change_amount") }}</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">الباقي</td></tr>
    {%- endif %}
  </table>
  <hr>
  <table style="width:100%;"><tr><td>Thank you</td><td dir="rtl" lang="ar" style="text-align:right;">شكراً لزيارتكم</td></tr></table>
</div>
